    9. useEffect vs useLayoutEffect?
        - useEffect is Async
        - useEffect invokes after paint
        - useEffect used to handle side effectds like API call
        - useLayoutEffect is Sync
        - useLayoutEffect invokes before paint
        - useLayoutEffect is used to handles task like measurement
    
