    18. core concept of redux? or architecture of redux?
        - Store - Single source of data
        - Action - Js object which describes what happened
        - Dispatcher - Sends action to store via reducer
        - Reducer - Pure function
        - Selector - reads the state from store
    
    19. What are middlewares?
        - Middleware is a function taht sits between an action and the dispatcher
        - will be able to delay, log the actions
        - request -> middleware -> findal handler-> response
        - types?
         Thunk and saga
         - Thunks? return the function rather than dispatching the action directly, which allows a delay of action
         - Saga? Has the Generator function which is more efficient than async await because it has yield keyword
    
